998.stem:
The diagram shows a rectangle $PQRS$ drawn in a sector $OAB$ with radius 5 metres.

It is given that $\angle AOB=\theta$, $OR=x$, $RS=y$ and $\tan\theta=2$.

\exfigure{1367_q29_1}

solutions.latex:
\exfigure{335_q32_s1}

The wire forms two radii and the arc $l=r\theta$:
$$\begin{aligned} L&=2r+r\theta\\ r\theta&=L-2r\\ \theta&=\dfrac{L-2r}{r} \end{aligned}$$

